OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GToday:FA cold and frosty start, but a  
OL,8,Fdry day with plenty of sunshine. Any   
OL,9,Fshowers in the far north will ease,    
OL,10,Fthough it will become breezier across  
OL,11,Fwestern and southwestern areas later.  
OL,12,FTemperature below the November average.
OL,14,GTonight:FCold overnight with           
OL,15,Fwidespread frost. Cloudier in          
OL,16,Fnortheast England and eastern Scotland 
OL,17,Fwith a few showers, wintry over hills. 
OL,18,FWind and cloud increasing in the       
OL,19,Fsouthwest, with rain arriving later.   
